function directionInstrumentText(row){
 const names={XAUUSD:'Gold',XAGUSD:'Silver',WTI:'WTI crude oil',BRENT:'Brent crude oil'};
 return [row.symbol,row.brokerSymbol,names[row.symbol]||''].join(' ');
}
function completedH1Bars(rows,now){
 return (rows||[]).filter(r=>{
  if(r.timeframe!=='H1'||r.status!=='COMPLETED')return false;
  const start=Date.parse(r.openUTC),end=Date.parse(r.endUTC),retrieved=Date.parse(r.retrievedUTC);
  return end-start===3600000&&end<=now&&retrieved<=now+120000&&end<=retrieved+120000
   &&[r.open,r.high,r.low,r.close].every(v=>Number.isFinite(v)&&v>0)
   &&r.high>=Math.max(r.open,r.close,r.low)&&r.low<=Math.min(r.open,r.close,r.high);
 });
}
function sameBarPrices(left,right){
 return ['open','high','low','close'].every(k=>
  Math.abs(left[k]-right[k])<=2e-5*Math.max(Math.abs(left[k]),Math.abs(right[k]),1e-9));
}
function hourDirection(rows,now=Date.now()){
 const candidates=completedH1Bars(rows,now);
 const latestEnd=candidates.reduce((end,row)=>Math.max(end,Date.parse(row.endUTC)),0);
 const bars=new Map();
 for(const row of candidates){
  if(Date.parse(row.endUTC)!==latestEnd)continue;
  const start=Date.parse(row.openUTC),previous=bars.get(start);
  if(previous&&!sameBarPrices(previous,row))return {ok:false,reason:'Conflicting H1 bars',bar:row};
  if(!previous||Date.parse(previous.retrievedUTC)<Date.parse(row.retrievedUTC))bars.set(start,row);
 }
 const bar=[...bars.values()].sort((a,b)=>Date.parse(a.endUTC)-Date.parse(b.endUTC)).at(-1);
 if(!bar)return {ok:false,reason:'Completed H1 history unavailable'};
 if(now-Date.parse(bar.endUTC)>90*60000)return {ok:false,reason:'Stale H1 candle',bar};
 if(now-Date.parse(bar.retrievedUTC)>30*60000)return {ok:false,reason:'History capture overdue',bar};
 const delta=bar.close-bar.open;return {ok:true,bar,value:delta/bar.open*100,delta,direction:delta>0?'Higher':delta<0?'Lower':'Flat'};
}

function fra40HistoryStatus(row,result,now,hour=result){
 if(row.broker!=='HFM'||row.symbol!=='ALT_FRA40.F'||row.brokerSymbol!=='FRA40.F')return result;
 const end=Date.parse(hour?.bar?.endUTC);
 if(hour?.ok&&Number.isFinite(end)&&now-end<=3600000)return result;
 return {ok:false,excluded:true,reason:'Not rated: HFM FRA40.F has no verified completed H1 candle in the last hour'};
}

function hourlyBrokerRows(feeds,now=Date.now()){
 const map=new Map();
 for(const f of feeds||[]){if(!['quotes','history'].includes(f.kind))continue;for(const r of f.rows||[]){if(f.kind==='history'&&r.timeframe!=='H1')continue;const key=JSON.stringify([f.broker,r.symbol,r.brokerSymbol]);let entry=map.get(key);if(!entry){entry={broker:f.broker,symbol:r.symbol,brokerSymbol:r.brokerSymbol,bars:[],receivedAt:null};map.set(key,entry);}if(f.kind==='history'){entry.bars.push(r);if(!entry.receivedAt||Date.parse(f.receivedAt)>Date.parse(entry.receivedAt))entry.receivedAt=f.receivedAt;}}}
 return [...map.values()].map(r=>({...r,result:fra40HistoryStatus(r,hourDirection(r.bars,now),now)})).sort((a,b)=>a.broker.localeCompare(b.broker)||a.symbol.localeCompare(b.symbol));
}

function intradayDirection(rows,hours,now=Date.now(),endpointOnly=false,allowPartialStart=false){
 if(![4,6,12,24].includes(hours))return {ok:false,reason:'Unsupported direction window'};
 const latest=hourDirection(rows,now);if(!latest.ok)return latest;
 const end=Date.parse(latest.bar.endUTC),start=end-hours*3600000,bars=new Map();
 for(const r of completedH1Bars(rows,now)){const t=Date.parse(r.endUTC);if(t<start||t>end)continue;
  const prior=bars.get(t);if(prior&&!sameBarPrices(prior,r))return {ok:false,reason:'Conflicting H1 history',bar:r};
  if(!prior||Date.parse(r.retrievedUTC)>Date.parse(prior.retrievedUTC))bars.set(t,r);
 }
 // Coverage can report an observed return when a short gap masks the start close.
 const hour=3600000;
 const openingBar=allowPartialStart&&endpointOnly&&!bars.has(start)
  ? [...bars.values()].sort((a,b)=>Date.parse(a.openUTC)-Date.parse(b.openUTC))[0] : null;
 const openingTime=Date.parse(openingBar?.openUTC);
 const useOpen=openingBar&&openingTime>=start&&openingTime-start<=3*hour&&end-openingTime>=2*hour;
 const missingCloses=[];
 for(let i=0;i<=hours;i++){const time=start+i*3600000,r=bars.get(time);if(!r){
  const close=new Date(time).toISOString();
  if(useOpen&&time<=openingTime)continue;
  if(endpointOnly&&i>0&&i<hours){missingCloses.push(close);continue;}
  return {ok:false,reason:'Incomplete exact '+hours+'h window (gap or market closure)',
   gap:{close,position:i===0?'Start endpoint':'Interior close',latest:latest.bar.endUTC}};
 }
  const retrieved=Date.parse(r.retrievedUTC);if(r.status!=='COMPLETED'||Date.parse(r.endUTC)-Date.parse(r.openUTC)!==3600000||!Number.isFinite(retrieved)||retrieved>now+120000||Date.parse(r.endUTC)>retrieved+120000||![r.open,r.high,r.low,r.close].every(Number.isFinite)||Math.min(r.open,r.high,r.low,r.close)<=0||r.high<Math.max(r.open,r.close,r.low)||r.low>Math.min(r.open,r.close,r.high))return {ok:false,reason:'Invalid H1 OHLC evidence'};
 }
 const first=bars.get(start),last=bars.get(end),openingPrice=useOpen?openingBar.open:first.close,value=(last.close/openingPrice-1)*100;
 return {ok:true,value,direction:value>0?'Higher':value<0?'Lower':'Flat',from:useOpen?openingBar.openUTC:first.endUTC,to:last.endUTC,start:openingPrice,end:last.close,observations:(useOpen?(end-openingTime)/hour:hours+1)-missingCloses.length,chartCloses:Array.from({length:hours+1},(_,i)=>bars.get(start+i*3600000)?.close??null),retrievedUTC:last.retrievedUTC,hours,...(endpointOnly?{evidenceMode:'dated-endpoints',missingCloses,coverageComplete:!useOpen&&missingCloses.length===0}:{}),...(useOpen?{observedFrom:openingBar.openUTC,observedHours:(end-openingTime)/hour}:{})};
}
function intradayEndpointEligible({broker,symbol,brokerSymbol}){
 return (BROKER_UNIVERSE[broker]||[]).some(m=>m.symbol===symbol&&m.brokerSymbol===brokerSymbol&&['metal','oil','equity-index','currency-index'].includes(m.asset));
}
function intradayBrokerRows(feeds,hours,now=Date.now(),allowPartialStart=false){
 const grouped=new Map();for(const f of feeds||[]){if(!['history','quotes'].includes(f.kind))continue;for(const r of f.rows||[]){if(f.kind==='history'&&r.timeframe!=='H1')continue;const key=JSON.stringify([f.broker,r.symbol,r.brokerSymbol]);if(!grouped.has(key))grouped.set(key,{broker:f.broker,symbol:r.symbol,brokerSymbol:r.brokerSymbol,bars:[],receivedAt:null});const g=grouped.get(key);if(f.kind==='history'){g.bars.push(r);if(!g.receivedAt||Date.parse(f.receivedAt)>Date.parse(g.receivedAt))g.receivedAt=f.receivedAt;}}}
 return [...grouped.values()].map(g=>({...g,result:fra40HistoryStatus(g,intradayDirection(g.bars,hours,now,intradayEndpointEligible(g),allowPartialStart),now,g.broker==='HFM'&&g.symbol==='ALT_FRA40.F'&&g.brokerSymbol==='FRA40.F'?hourDirection(g.bars,now):null)})).sort((a,b)=>a.broker.localeCompare(b.broker)||a.symbol.localeCompare(b.symbol));
}

function brokerConnectionState(quoteAvailable,quoteCurrent,direction){
 const limitedHorizons=Object.entries(direction).filter(([,value])=>!value.excluded&&(!value.ok||value.missingCloses>0||value.observedFrom))
  .map(([hours])=>Number(hours));
 return {connectionState:!quoteAvailable?'Quote missing':!quoteCurrent?'Connected / quote overdue':
  limitedHorizons.length?'Current quote / history limited':'Connected and current',limitedHorizons};
}

function buildBrokerCoverage(feeds,now=Date.now()){
 const canonicalFeeds=selectCanonicalHfmHistory(feeds||[]);
 const key=r=>JSON.stringify([r.broker,r.symbol,r.brokerSymbol]);
 const windows=Object.fromEntries([1,4,6,12,24].map(h=>[h,new Map((h===1?hourlyBrokerRows(canonicalFeeds,now):intradayBrokerRows(canonicalFeeds,h,now,true)).map(r=>[key(r),r.result]))]));
 const evidence=new Map();
 for(const feed of canonicalFeeds)for(const row of feed.rows||[]){const id=key({...row,broker:feed.broker});let e=evidence.get(id);if(!e){e={quote:null,captureUTC:null,latestH1EndUTC:null,dailyAvailable:false};evidence.set(id,e);}
  if(feed.kind==='quotes'&&(!e.quote||Date.parse(row.retrievedUTC)>Date.parse(e.quote.retrievedUTC)))e.quote=row;
  if(row.timeframe==='H1'){if(!e.captureUTC||row.retrievedUTC>e.captureUTC)e.captureUTC=row.retrievedUTC;if(!e.latestH1EndUTC||row.endUTC>e.latestH1EndUTC)e.latestH1EndUTC=row.endUTC;}
  if(row.timeframe==='D1')e.dailyAvailable=true;
 }
 const groups=Object.entries(BROKER_UNIVERSE).map(([broker,universe])=>{
  const rows=universe.map(item=>{
   const e=evidence.get(key({...item,broker}))||{},quote=e.quote;
   const direction=Object.fromEntries([1,4,6,12,24].map(h=>{const r=windows[h].get(key({...item,broker}));return [h,r?{ok:r.ok,reason:r.reason||null,...(r.excluded?{excluded:true}:{}),missingCloses:r.missingCloses?.length||0,...(r.observedFrom?{observedFrom:r.observedFrom,observedHours:r.observedHours}:{})}:{ok:false,reason:'Completed H1 history unavailable'}];}));
   const quoteCurrent=!!quote&&quote.clockValid!==false&&quote.terminalConnected!==false&&quote.sourceStatus==='OK'
    &&now-Date.parse(quote.quoteUTC)<=120000&&Date.parse(quote.quoteUTC)<=now+120000;
   return {...item,quoteAvailable:!!quote,quoteCurrent,...brokerConnectionState(!!quote,quoteCurrent,direction),
    quoteUTC:quote?.quoteUTC||null,captureUTC:e.captureUTC||null,
    latestH1EndUTC:e.latestH1EndUTC||null,dailyAvailable:!!e.dailyAvailable,direction};
  });
  return {broker,rows};
 });
 // Batch 4: a symbol stale on every broker that carries it is consistent with a closed underlying
 // session (both feeds see the same market); a symbol fresh on one broker but stale on another, for
 // the same canonical symbol, is not explained by a closed session and is flagged for feed follow-up.
 // This reuses evidence the collector already has (cross-broker agreement) rather than guessing any
 // per-asset session calendar.
 const brokersBySymbol1h=new Map();
 for(const {broker,rows} of groups)for(const r of rows){if(r.direction[1].excluded)continue;if(!brokersBySymbol1h.has(r.symbol))brokersBySymbol1h.set(r.symbol,[]);brokersBySymbol1h.get(r.symbol).push({broker,ok:r.direction[1].ok});}
 for(const {broker,rows} of groups)for(const r of rows){
  if(r.direction[1].excluded||r.direction[1].ok){r.crossBrokerAgreement=null;continue;}
  const peers=(brokersBySymbol1h.get(r.symbol)||[]).filter(p=>p.broker!==broker);
  r.crossBrokerAgreement=!peers.length?'single-broker coverage; no cross-check available'
   :peers.every(p=>!p.ok)?'also stale on '+peers.map(p=>p.broker).join(', ')+' - consistent with a closed session'
   :'fresh on '+peers.filter(p=>p.ok).map(p=>p.broker).join(', ')+' - not explained by a closed session; check this broker\'s feed';
 }
 return groups.map(({broker,rows})=>({broker,expected:rows.length,currentQuotes:rows.filter(r=>r.quoteCurrent).length,connectedQuotes:rows.filter(r=>r.quoteAvailable).length,dailyConnected:rows.filter(r=>r.dailyAvailable).length,
   rated:Object.fromEntries([1,4,6,12,24].map(h=>[h,rows.filter(r=>r.direction[h].ok).length])),
   directionExpected:Object.fromEntries([1,4,6,12,24].map(h=>[h,rows.filter(r=>!r.direction[h].excluded).length])),rows}));
}

const BROKER_FEEDS={PUPrime_common_quotes:{broker:'PU Prime',kind:'quotes'},HFM_quotes:{broker:'HFM',kind:'quotes'},PUPrime_quotes:{broker:'PU Prime',kind:'quotes'},HFM_H1H4:{broker:'HFM',kind:'history'},PUPrime_H1H4:{broker:'PU Prime',kind:'history'},HFM_daily:{broker:'HFM',kind:'daily'},PUPrime_daily:{broker:'PU Prime',kind:'daily'},HFM_all_quotes:{broker:'HFM',kind:'quotes'},HFM_all_history:{broker:'HFM',kind:'history'},HFM_all_daily:{broker:'HFM',kind:'daily'},PUPrime_all_quotes:{broker:'PU Prime',kind:'quotes'},PUPrime_all_history:{broker:'PU Prime',kind:'history'},PUPrime_all_daily:{broker:'PU Prime',kind:'daily'}};
const brokerDate=value=>typeof value==='string'&&Number.isFinite(Date.parse(value));
const brokerSymbol=value=>typeof value==='string'&&/^[A-Za-z0-9._/# -]{1,48}$/.test(value);
function validateBrokerFeed(input,now=Date.now()){
 if(input?.feedId==='HFM_H1H4'&&input.fileName==='HFM_H1H4_CURRENT.csv')input={...input,feedId:'HFM_legacy_history'};

 const def=BROKER_FEEDS[input?.feedId];if(!def||def.broker!==input.broker||def.kind!==input.kind)throw Error('Unknown broker feed');
 if(!brokerDate(input.sourceModifiedUTC)||Date.parse(input.sourceModifiedUTC)>now+120000)throw Error('Invalid source-file timestamp');
 if(!Array.isArray(input.rows)||!input.rows.length||input.rows.length>60000)throw Error('Invalid market-data row count');
 const rows=input.rows.map(r=>{
  if(!brokerSymbol(r.symbol)||!brokerSymbol(r.brokerSymbol)||!brokerDate(r.retrievedUTC)||Date.parse(r.retrievedUTC)>now+120000)throw Error('Invalid instrument or retrieval timestamp');
  const base={symbol:r.symbol,brokerSymbol:r.brokerSymbol,retrievedUTC:r.retrievedUTC};
  if(def.kind==='quotes'){
   if(![r.bid,r.ask,r.point,r.pipSize].every(Number.isFinite)||r.bid<=0||r.ask<r.bid||r.point<=0||r.pipSize<=0||!brokerDate(r.quoteUTC))throw Error('Invalid quote');
   const clockValid=Date.parse(r.quoteUTC)<=Date.parse(r.retrievedUTC)+120000&&Date.parse(r.quoteUTC)<=now+120000;
   const specification={};for(const key of ['tickSize','tickValueProfit','tickValueLoss','contractSize','minLot','lotStep','maxLot'])if(Number.isFinite(r[key])&&r[key]>0&&r[key]<1e12)specification[key]=r[key];
   if(typeof r.valueCurrency==='string'&&/^[A-Z]{3}$/.test(r.valueCurrency))specification.valueCurrency=r.valueCurrency;
   if(Object.keys(specification).length)specification.specRetrievedUTC=brokerDate(r.specRetrievedUTC)&&Date.parse(r.specRetrievedUTC)<=Date.parse(r.retrievedUTC)?r.specRetrievedUTC:r.retrievedUTC;
   return{...base,...specification,...(['fx-pip','price-point'].includes(r.priceUnitType)?{priceUnitType:r.priceUnitType}:{}),bid:r.bid,ask:r.ask,point:r.point,pipSize:r.pipSize,quoteUTC:r.quoteUTC,sourceStatus:String(r.sourceStatus||'Unknown').slice(0,40),terminalConnected:typeof r.terminalConnected==='boolean'?r.terminalConnected:null,clockValid,clockIssue:clockValid?null:'Quote time is ahead of retrieval; UTC normalization is unverified'};
  }
  if(!['H1','H4','D1'].includes(r.timeframe)||(def.kind==='history'&&!['H1','H4'].includes(r.timeframe))||(def.kind==='daily'&&r.timeframe!=='D1')||r.status!=='COMPLETED'||![r.open,r.high,r.low,r.close].every(Number.isFinite)||Math.min(r.open,r.high,r.low,r.close)<=0||r.high<Math.max(r.open,r.close,r.low)||r.low>Math.min(r.open,r.close,r.high)||!brokerDate(r.openUTC)||!brokerDate(r.endUTC)||Date.parse(r.endUTC)<=Date.parse(r.openUTC)||Date.parse(r.endUTC)>Math.min(now,Date.parse(r.retrievedUTC))+120000)throw Error('Invalid or incomplete OHLC bar');
  const duration=(Date.parse(r.endUTC)-Date.parse(r.openUTC))/3600000;if(duration!==({H1:1,H4:4,D1:24})[r.timeframe])throw Error('Unexpected bar duration');
  return{...base,timeframe:r.timeframe,openUTC:r.openUTC,endUTC:r.endUTC,open:r.open,high:r.high,low:r.low,close:r.close,status:'COMPLETED'};
 });
 return{feedId:input.feedId,...def,fileName:String(input.fileName||'CSV export').replace(/[^A-Za-z0-9_. -]/g,'').slice(0,100),sourceModifiedUTC:input.sourceModifiedUTC,receivedAt:new Date(now).toISOString(),rows,rejectedRows:Number.isInteger(input.rejectedRows)&&input.rejectedRows>=0?input.rejectedRows:0};
}
function retainBrokerSpecifications(record,prior){
 if(record.kind!=='quotes'||!prior)return record;
 const keys=['tickSize','tickValueProfit','tickValueLoss','contractSize','minLot','lotStep','maxLot','valueCurrency','specRetrievedUTC'];
 const old=new Map(prior.rows.map(r=>[r.symbol+'|'+r.brokerSymbol,r]));
 for(const row of record.rows){const previous=old.get(row.symbol+'|'+row.brokerSymbol);if(!row.specRetrievedUTC&&previous?.specRetrievedUTC)for(const key of keys)if(previous[key]!==undefined)row[key]=previous[key];}
 return record;
}
function brokerHistoryKey(row){return [row.symbol,row.brokerSymbol,row.timeframe].join('|');}
function canonicalHfmHistoryKeys(feeds){
 const native=new Set();
 for(const feed of feeds)if(feed?.feedId==='HFM_H1H4'||feed?.feedId==='HFM_all_history'){
  for(const row of feed.rows||[])if(row.status==='COMPLETED')native.add(brokerHistoryKey(row));
 }
 return native;
}
function selectCanonicalHfmHistory(feeds){
 const native=canonicalHfmHistoryKeys(feeds);
 return feeds.filter(Boolean).map(feed=>feed.feedId==='HFM_legacy_history'?
  {...feed,rows:feed.rows.filter(row=>!native.has(brokerHistoryKey(row)))}:feed);
}

async function readBrokerBridgeFeed(bucket,feedId){
 const item=await bucket.get('broker/'+feedId+'.json');
 return item?item.json():null;
}

async function readBrokerBridgeFeeds(bucket){
 return (await Promise.all(Object.keys(BROKER_FEEDS).map(id=>readBrokerBridgeFeed(bucket,id)))).filter(Boolean);
}

function brokerBridgeReceipt(feed){
 return {receivedAt:feed?.receivedAt||null,rowCount:feed?.rows?.length??0};
}

function brokerBridgeCoverage(feeds){
 return feeds.map(feed=>{
  const assets=new Map((BROKER_UNIVERSE[feed.broker]||[]).map(r=>[JSON.stringify([r.symbol,r.brokerSymbol]),r.asset]));
  const rowsByAsset={};
  for(const row of feed.rows){
   const asset=assets.get(JSON.stringify([row.symbol,row.brokerSymbol]));
   if(asset)rowsByAsset[asset]=(rowsByAsset[asset]||0)+1;
  }
  return {broker:feed.broker,feedId:feed.feedId,...brokerBridgeReceipt(feed),rowsByAsset};
 });
}

async function brokerApi(request,env){
 const url=new URL(request.url),headers={'Cache-Control':'no-store'};
 if(!env.BUCKET)return Response.json({error:'Cloud storage unavailable'},{status:503,headers});
 if(url.pathname==='/api/broker/coverage'){
  if(request.method!=='GET')return Response.json({error:'Use GET'},{status:405,headers});
  const feeds=await readBrokerBridgeFeeds(env.BUCKET),saved=await iceRead(env.BUCKET,'ice/latest.json');
  const receipts={bridgeFeeds:brokerBridgeCoverage(feeds),checkedAt:new Date().toISOString(),
   macro:saved?{runId:saved.runId,capturedAt:saved.analysis?.capturedAt||saved.bundle?.capturedAt,
    success:saved.analysis?.sourceSuccess,total:saved.analysis?.sourceTotal}:null};
  if(url.searchParams.get('view')==='receipts')return Response.json(receipts,{headers});
  return Response.json({...receipts,brokers:buildBrokerCoverage(feeds)},{headers});
 }
 if(url.pathname==='/api/broker/ticks')return tickStatusApi(request,env);
 if(url.pathname==='/api/broker/ingest'){
  if(request.method!=='POST'||!request.headers.get('content-type')?.startsWith('application/json'))return Response.json({error:'Use JSON POST'},{status:405,headers});
  if(request.headers.get('origin')&&request.headers.get('origin')!==url.origin)return Response.json({error:'Cross-origin write rejected'},{status:403,headers});
  try{const text=await request.text();if(text.length>25000000)return Response.json({error:'CSV capture is too large'},{status:413,headers});const record=validateBrokerFeed(JSON.parse(text));const priorItem=await env.BUCKET.get('broker/'+record.feedId+'.json'),prior=priorItem?await priorItem.json():null;if(prior){const newest=rows=>rows.reduce((m,r)=>Math.max(m,Date.parse(r.retrievedUTC)||0),0);if(newest(record.rows)<newest(prior.rows))return Response.json({error:'Older source capture rejected; newer saved market data retained'},{status:409,headers});}retainBrokerSpecifications(record,prior);await env.BUCKET.put('broker/'+record.feedId+'.json',JSON.stringify(record),{httpMetadata:{contentType:'application/json'}});return Response.json({saved:true,feedId:record.feedId,receivedAt:record.receivedAt,rowCount:record.rows.length},{headers});}catch(e){return Response.json({error:e.message},{status:400,headers});}
 }
 if(url.pathname==='/api/broker/latest'){
  const feeds=await readBrokerBridgeFeeds(env.BUCKET);return Response.json({feeds,nativeHfmHistoryKeys:[...canonicalHfmHistoryKeys(feeds)],checkedAt:new Date().toISOString(),readOnly:true},{headers});
 }
 return Response.json({error:'Unknown broker route'},{status:404,headers});
}

const ICE_RANK_MIN_COVERAGE = 85;

const governanceDate = value => typeof value === 'string' && Number.isFinite(Date.parse(value)) ? value : null;

function indicatorFreshness(point, feed, release, status, now = Date.now()) {
  if (!point || !Number.isFinite(point.v) || !governanceDate(point.d)) return 'Unavailable';
  if (Date.parse(point.d) > now) return 'Observation date invalid';
  // A verified release must be tied to the exact series and its reference period.
  if (!release || !governanceDate(release.publishedAt) || Date.parse(release.publishedAt) > now
      || !governanceDate(release.period)) return 'Schedule unverified';
  if (Number.isFinite(release.confirmedPolicyValue)) {
    if (Math.abs(point.v-release.confirmedPolicyValue) > 1e-8) return 'Policy differs from last verified decision';
  } else {
    if (point.d < release.period) return 'Superseded';
    if (point.d !== release.period) return 'Period unverified';
  }
  if (governanceDate(release.nextDueAt) && Date.parse(release.nextDueAt) <= now) {
    return 'Expected release due / unverified';
  }
  if (status?.ok !== true || !governanceDate(feed?.retrievedAt)
      || Date.parse(feed.retrievedAt) < Date.parse(release.publishedAt)
      || Date.parse(feed.retrievedAt) > now) return 'Cached / collection unverified';
  return governanceDate(release.nextDueAt) ? 'Current' : 'Latest release verified / next date unknown';
}

